| !Run for !Freeciv - RISC OS port of Freeciv (SDL2 client and server)
| Built with GCCSDK GCC 10.2 (arm-riscos-gnueabihf), statically linked with
| riscos-mesa's SDL2, and converted to Absolute (AIF) files, so
| !SharedLibs isn't needed.

Set Freeciv$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set Freeciv$Path <Obey$Dir>.
IconSprites <Freeciv$Dir>.!Sprites

Obey <Freeciv$Dir>.Setup

| --- Sound ------------------------------------------------------------
| Sound goes through SharedSoundBuffer, StreamManager and SharedSound
| (in !System), mixed with other programs' sound. SharedSoundBuffer and
| StreamManager are in ssb.zip from
| https://orac.co.uk/software/rdpclient/rdpclient.html. Without
| them the game plays silently.
RMEnsure SharedSound 1.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSound Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSound
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 IfThere System:Modules.StreamMan Then RMLoad System:Modules.StreamMan
RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSBuffer Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSBuffer

| --- Server -----------------------------------------------------------
| "Start new game" plays on the server started with !CivServer if one is
| running; otherwise it starts the server (freeciv-server) itself, in a
| TaskWindow that closes again when the game ends. Its WimpSlot:
Set FreecivServer$WimpSlot 36000K

| --- Logging ----------------------------------------------------------
| Normally nothing is logged. For a log, remove the | from the next line
| (or *Set Freeciv$Log 1 before running): the client writes to
| <Wimp$ScrapDir>.FreecivLog and the server to <Wimp$ScrapDir>.FreecivSrvLog.
| Set Freeciv$Log 1
Set Freeciv$Output /dev/null
Unset FreecivServer$Output
If "<Freeciv$Log>"<>"" Then Set Freeciv$Output /|<Wimp$ScrapDir>/FreecivLog
If "<Freeciv$Log>"<>"" Then Set FreecivServer$Output /|<Wimp$ScrapDir>/FreecivSrvLog
Unset Freeciv$LogArg
If "<Freeciv$Log>"<>"" Then Set Freeciv$LogArg --debug 3

| --- Memory ---------------------------------------------------------
| The C heap goes in a dynamic area ("Freeciv Heap"), so the WimpSlot only
| holds the program (about 35MB with its tables) and its stack.
WimpSlot -min 44000K -max 44000K

| --- Program -------------------------------------------------------
Do Run <Freeciv$Dir>.freeciv-sdl2 <Freeciv$LogArg> %*0
